erior:`Previous chapter`,aria_cap_siguiente:`Next chapter`,libros_filtro_aria:`Filter books`,libros_filtro_todos:`All`,libros_filtro_favoritos:`Favorites`,libros_filtro_comentarios:`Comments`,ora_comunes:`Common prayers`,ora_mas:`More prayers`,libros_filtro_vacio:`No books match this filter`,avi_resumen_ninguno:`None active`,avi_resumen_uno:`1 active`,avi_resumen_n:`{n} active`,aj_resumen_letra:`Font size · {v}`,aria_salmo_anterior:`Previous psalm`,aria_salmo_siguiente:`Next psalm`,act_hay_titulo:`New version available`,act_hay_texto:`Version {version}. It downloads while you keep reading.`,act_actualizar:`Update`,act_mas_tarde:`Later`,act_descargando:`Downloading update…`,act_lista_titulo:`Update ready`,act_lista_texto:`Restart the app to install version {version}.`,act_reiniciar:`Restart to update`,act_fallo:`The update could not be downloaded`,act_sin_ficha:`If Google Play doesn't show the app, the update isn't available yet.`,act_fila_titulo:`Check for updates`,act_fila_reposo:`See if there is a new version`,act_fila_buscando:`Checking…`,act_fila_al_dia:`You have the latest version ({version})`,act_fila_hay:`A new version is available ({version}). Tap to update`,act_fila_lista:`Update ready ({version}). Tap to restart`,act_fila_sin_conexion:`Could not check. Check your connection`,act_fila_fuera:`Could not check here. Open Google Play to see if there is a new version`,nov_titulo:`What’s new`,nov_version:`Version {version}`,nov_entendido:`Got it`,nov_v0100_rosario_t:`Guided Rosary`,nov_v0100_rosario_d:`Pray it step by step with the mysteries of the day, offline.`,nov_v0100_ficha_t:`Book details`,nov_v0100_ficha_d:`Tap the avatar of a New Testament book to see its summary and author.`,nov_v0102_ficha_t:`Old Testament book details`,nov_v0102_ficha_d:`Old Testament books now have details too: tap the avatar to see the summary and the author.`,nov_v0102_compartir_t:`Share verses`,nov_v0102_compartir_d:`Select one or more verses and tap share to send them on WhatsApp or another app, with their reference.`,nov_v0104_hoy_t:`Readings of the day in Today`,nov_v0104_hoy_d:`Today shows the readings from the curas.com.ar lectionary, with the Alleluia row between the Psalm and the Gospel. The "Show texts" switch expands or collapses everything at once.`,nov_v0104_buscador_t:`Search and Hail Mary`,nov_v0104_buscador_d:`The search pill is now easier to tap and the three opening Hail Marys of the Rosary show their ordinal.`,nov_v0106_capitulos_t:`Change chapter with one tap`,nov_v0106_capitulos_d:`Inside a book there is a bottom bar to go to the previous or next chapter, with search in the middle. It hides when you scroll down and comes back when you scroll up a little, tap the text or a few seconds pass without scrolling.`,nov_v0106_hoy_t:`Today, easier to read`,nov_v0106_hoy_d:`In Today, the name of each reading (First reading, Psalm, Gospel) stands out with the reference below it. When viewing another day, the Today button sits next to the labels, and you can also come back by tapping the Today tab.`,nov_v0106_texto_t:`More text options`,nov_v0106_texto_d:`In Settings, the Text group brings together font size, alignment (with a justified option), line spacing and continuous scrolling.`,nov_v0100_lectura_t:`Easier reading`,nov_v0100_lectura_d:`Phrases now stay whole on each line, verses and prayers are indented, and there are more text sizes.`,nov_v0100_hoy_t:`Today`,nov_v0100_hoy_d:`The header takes the liturgical color of the day and you see the cycle (A, B or C) every day.`,nov_v105_voz_t:`Read aloud`,nov_v105_voz_d:`Listen to chapters and prayers with your phone's voice. In Settings, Voice, choose speed, pitch and voice, and follow each highlighted word.`,nov_v105_rosario_t:`Full Rosary`,nov_v105_rosario_d:`The whole Rosary on one screen, with read-aloud. The guided mode stays as Automatic mode. We also added the prayer Blessed Be Thy Purity.`,nov_v105_comentarios_t:`Comments`,nov_v105_comentarios_d:`What you write on verses is now called a comment. Your earlier comments are still there.`,nov_v105_planes_t:`Plan reminders`,nov_v105_planes_d:`Choose what time you want your plan to remind you.`,nov_v107_corona_t:`Reading progress ring`,nov_v107_corona_d:`The book avatar in the top bar shows how much of the book you have read.`,nov_v107_voz_t:`More reliable voice`,nov_v107_voz_d:`If the voice engine is slow to start, the app retries on its own. If reading aloud is not possible, the message is now clearer.`,nov_v107_fichas_t:`New Testament profiles`,nov_v107_fichas_d:`Summary and author renewed for all 27 books. As you scroll a profile, the avatar settles at the top, like a WhatsApp profile.`,nov_v107_movimiento_t:`Animated tabs`,nov_v107_movimiento_d:`The bottom tabs now have a pill that expands when you tap them.`,nov_v108_buscar_t:`Search in the menu`,nov_v108_buscar_d:`"Search" is now in the three-dot menu, and the search bar no longer stays fixed on Today.`,nov_v108_lecturas_t:`Share the readings`,nov_v108_lecturas_d:`On Today, tap the share icon to send all of the day's readings together, or the one on each reading to send just that one.`,nov_v108_oraciones_t:`Share prayers`,nov_v108_oraciones_d:`Every prayer has a share icon at the top so you can send it to anyone.`,nov_v108_calendario_t:`Clearer calendar`,nov_v108_calendario_d:`The date on Today now looks like a button, with a small hint that you can tap it to change the day.`,nov_v108_tarjetas_t:`More compact plans`,nov_v108_tarjetas_d:`The reading plan cards are smaller, so more of them fit on the screen.`,nov_v108_fluida_t:`Smoother app`,nov_v108_fluida_d:`We improved startup and switching between tabs so everything moves more smoothly.`,nov_v1012_menu_t:`What's new, close at hand`,nov_v1012_menu_d:`Find it in the ⋮ menu, between Settings and About. A red dot tells you when there is something new to see.`,nov_v1012_lecturas_t:`Today's readings in cards`,nov_v1012_lecturas_d:`Each reading has its own card with the book's avatar. The switch now says "Show texts".`,nov_v1012_titulo_t:`Search from the title`,nov_v1012_titulo_d:`While reading a book, tap the title at the top to open search.`,nov_v110_senaladores_t:`Colored bookmarks`,nov_v110_senaladores_d:`Mark verses with colors.`,nov_v110_hoy_t:`Today`,nov_v110_hoy_d:`The day’s readings, offline.`,nov_v110_ingles_t:`English`,nov_v110_ingles_d:`Read the Bible in English too.`,avi_titulo:`Reminders`,avi_cat_det:`Reading plan, today's reading, Angelus and Rosary`,avi_sec_lectura:`Reading`,avi_sec_oracion:`Prayer`,avi_lectura:`Today's reading`,avi_lectura_det_off:`One notice a day with the liturgy`,avi_lectura_det_on:`We notify you with the title of the day`,avi_angelus:`Angelus`,avi_angelus_det:`At {a} and at {b}`,avi_rosario:`Rosary`,avi_rosario_det:`One notice a day`,avi_hora:`Time`,avi_hora_mediodia:`Noon`,avi_hora_tarde:`Evening`,avi_hora_aria:`{aviso}: {hora}. Tap to change the time`,avi_activado:`On`,avi_desactivado:`Off`,avi_dentro:`Also show inside the app`,avi_dentro_det_on:`With the app open, the notice also shows here`,avi_dentro_det_off:`Only the phone notification is shown`,avi_modal_ir_angelus:`Pray the Angelus`,avi_modal_ir_rosario:`Pray the Rosary`,avi_modal_ir_plan:`Go to my plan`,avi_modal_ir_hoy:`See today's reading`,avi_modal_ahora_no:`Not now`,avi_sec_app:`In the app`,avi_felic:`Congratulations`,avi_felic_det:`Show messages with confetti when you read several days, several readings or all of today's readings`,avi_pie:`Notices are scheduled on your phone: they use no internet and send no data. You can turn them off whenever you want.`,avi_permiso_denegado:`We could not turn the notice on because notifications are blocked for this app. Enable them in Android settings (Apps, Biblia Católica Offline, Notifications) and try again.`,avi_canal:`Reminders`,avi_n_lectura_titulo:`Today's reading`,avi_n_lectura_cuerpo:`Today's reading · tap to open`,avi_n_angelus_titulo:`Angelus`,avi_n_angelus_cuerpo:`Time to pray the Angelus · tap to open`,av